  - PDF (`.pdf`): Red (`text-rose-500`)
  - Word / Docs (`.docx`, `.doc`): Blue (`text-blue-600`)
  - Excel / Spreadsheets (`.xlsx`, `.xls`, `.csv`): Green (`text-emerald-600`)
  - Presentation / PPTX (`.pptx`, `.ppt`): Orange (`text-amber-500`)
  - Images (`.png`, `.jpg`, `.jpeg`, `.webp`): Violet (`text-violet-600`)
  - Archives (`.zip`, `.rar`, `.7z`): Amber (`text-amber-600`)
  - Google Drive (`external_url`): Official Multi-color Google Drive SVG
  - Other / Generic: Slate (`text-slate-500`)
- [x] Integrated `DocumentTypeIcon` across all document views:
