## Lessons & Notes
- Semantic icon color-coding (PDF in red, Word in blue, Excel in green, PPTX in orange, PNG in violet, ZIP in amber, Drive in multi-color) provides immediate visual recognition across all accreditation criteria and repository tables.
- Replicating the previous design provides immediate familiarity for users while migrating from Blade/Livewire to Vue 3 Composition API + Inertia.js.
- Decomposing the workspace into small single-purpose sub-components ensures maintainability and strictly stays under the 150-200 line cap.
